<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="fissure-stone-fragments">Fissure Stone Fragments for Shadow Priest DPS Pre-Raid</h3>
<a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=3148/fissure-stone-fragment">
<span>
<img alt="Fissure Stone Fragment" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_talisman_16.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fissure Stone Fragment</span></span></a>s are a new currency introduced with Rage of the Firelands. There are a wide range of items available through this currency, meaning which items to prioritize are based on whatever the largest upgrade is for you specifically. Generally, you will want to aim for any item which has an item level of 379, such as <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=60237/crown-of-the-twilight-queen">
<img alt="Crown of the Twilight Queen" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helm_robe_raidmage_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Crown of the Twilight Queen</span></a>, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=60232/shroud-of-endless-grief">
<img alt="Shroud of Endless Grief" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_cataclysm_caster_c_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Shroud of Endless Grief</span></a>, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=60238/bracers-of-the-dark-mother">
<img alt="Bracers of the Dark Mother" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_cloth_raidpriest_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Bracers of the Dark Mother</span></a>, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=65105/theralions-mirror">
<img alt="Theralion's Mirror" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_arcane_teleportironforge.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Theralion's Mirror</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=65043/mantle-of-nefarius">
<img alt="Mantle of Nefarius" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shoulder_cloth_raidpriest_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Mantle of Nefarius</span></a>.<br/>
<br/>You can then look to get any of the random enchantment items, a weapon, off-hand or wand as necessary. A lot of these item slots have a better alternative from either <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a> or <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/guide/molten-front-zone-overview">The Molten Front</a> quests or vendors.<br/>
<br/>
