<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="body-armor">Body Armor for Shadow Priest DPS</h3>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="head-for-shadow-priest-dps">Head for Shadow Priest DPS</h4>With the addition of Inferno Protocol Dungeons you will want to try and grab <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=60237/crown-of-the-twilight-queen">
<img alt="Crown of the Twilight Queen" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helm_robe_raidmage_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Crown of the Twilight Queen</span></a>. You can opt for Tier pieces early on if you want. The set bonuses are decent enough, and they are significantly cheaper than <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=60237/crown-of-the-twilight-queen">
<img alt="Crown of the Twilight Queen" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helm_robe_raidmage_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Crown of the Twilight Queen</span></a>. That said, you won't be using the 4-set for too long, so feel free to grab any alternative.<br/>
<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=59449/lightweight-bio-optic-killshades">
<img alt="Lightweight Bio-Optic Killshades" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gizmo_newgoggles.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Lightweight Bio-Optic Killshades</span></a> is <a class="icontiny" data-entity="skill" data-game="wow" data-type="skill" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/skill=202/engineering">
<img alt="Engineering" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engineering.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Engineering</span></a> exclusive, but it is a fantastic piece, allowing you to give it your preferred stats. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=67147/jetzes-sparkling-tiara">
<img alt="Je'Tze's Sparkling Tiara" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_cloth_raidpriest_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Je'Tze's Sparkling Tiara</span></a> is potentially better, but being BoE means there is also a steep price tag involved. <br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Helm Enchant</b>: <a class="q7 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62367/arcanum-of-hyjal">
<img alt="Arcanum of Hyjal" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_fire_masterofelements.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Arcanum of Hyjal</span></a>, requires <span class="rep-revered">Revered</span> reputation with <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/faction=1158/guardians-of-hyjal">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Guardians of Hyjal</span></a>.<div class="pad"></div>
