<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="shoulders-for-shadow-priest-dps">Shoulders for Shadow Priest DPS</h4>With the addition of Inferno Protocol Dungeons you will want to try and grab Tier pieces. The set bonuses are decent enough, and the individual pieces are <i>generally</i> well itemized. That said, you won't be using the 4-set for too long, so feel free to grab any alternative.<br/>
<br/>You can't go wrong with either <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=69612/claw-fringe-mantle">
<img alt="Claw-Fringe Mantle" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shoulder_102.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Claw-Fringe Mantle</span></a> or <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=69560/janalais-spaulders">
<img alt="Jan'alai's Spaulders" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shoulder_82.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Jan'alai's Spaulders</span></a>. Grab whichever drops first and don't worry about the other one.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Shoulder Enchant</b>: <a class="q7 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62343/greater-inscription-of-charged-lodestone">
<img alt="Greater Inscription of Charged Lodestone" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_gem_bloodstone_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Greater Inscription of Charged Lodestone</span></a>, requires <span class="rep-revered">Revered</span> reputation with <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/faction=1171/therazane">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Therazane</span></a>, or <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=86403/felfire-inscription">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_mastersinscription.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Felfire Inscription</span></a> - Only Scribes may apply Shoulder Inscriptions on their own Shoulders.<div class="pad"></div>
