<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="back-for-shadow-priest-dps">Back for Shadow Priest DPS</h4>The best choice is <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=60232/shroud-of-endless-grief">
<img alt="Shroud of Endless Grief" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_cataclysm_caster_c_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Shroud of Endless Grief</span></a>, but this comes at a whopping 80 <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=3148/fissure-stone-fragment">
<span>
<img alt="Fissure Stone Fragment" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_talisman_16.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fissure Stone Fragment</span></span></a>s. To tide you over, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71267/mantle-of-desire">
<img alt="Mantle of Desire" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_cape_firelands_fireset_d_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Mantle of Desire</span></a> is perfect for us, but it does require a good deal of <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/zone=5733/molten-front">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Molten Front</span></a> questing to get your hands on. Otherwise, there are a handful of options available from Inferno Protocol Dungeons to keep an eye on. <br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Cloak Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74240/enchant-cloak-greater-intellect">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engraving.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Cloak - Greater Intellect</span></a>
