<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="chest-for-shadow-priest-dps">Chest for Shadow Priest DPS</h4>With the shifting of items from <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a> to <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=395/justice-points">
<span>
<img alt="Justice Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-justice.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Justice Points</span></span></a>, you could grab <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=60254/mercurial-vestment">
<img alt="Mercurial Vestment" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_cloth_raidpriest_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Mercurial Vestment</span></a>. The set bonuses are decent enough, and the piece is decently well itemized. If you are looking for something to spend <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a> on instead, grab <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71279/vestment-of-the-cleansing-flame">
<img alt="Vestment of the Cleansing Flame" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_robe_raidpriest_j_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Vestment of the Cleansing Flame</span></a> and get started on your next Tier set. <br/>
<br/>A solid slot to spend your <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a> on. Grab <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71279/vestment-of-the-cleansing-flame">
<img alt="Vestment of the Cleansing Flame" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_robe_raidpriest_j_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Vestment of the Cleansing Flame</span></a> to get your tier dreams started. If you have more money than sense, you could pick up <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=67133/dizzes-whirling-robe">
<img alt="Dizze's Whirling Robe" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_cloth_raidwarlock_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Dizze's Whirling Robe</span></a> to tide you over.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Chest Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74250/enchant-chest-peerless-stats">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_formulagood_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Chest - Peerless Stats</span></a>
