<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="wrist-for-shadow-priest-dps">Wrist for Shadow Priest DPS</h4>If you have either <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a> or gold to spend, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71266/firesoul-wristguards">
<img alt="Firesoul Wristguards" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_robe_raidpriest_j_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Firesoul Wristguards</span></a> is a great grab. Otherwise, grab <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=60238/bracers-of-the-dark-mother">
<img alt="Bracers of the Dark Mother" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_cloth_raidpriest_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Bracers of the Dark Mother</span></a>.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Bracer Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=85010/draconic-embossment-intellect">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_leatherworking.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Draconic Embossment - Intellect</span></a> for Leatherworkers, otherwise <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=68786/enchant-bracer-mighty-intellect">
<img alt="Enchant Bracer - Mighty Intellect" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_enchantedscroll.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Bracer - Mighty Intellect</span></a>.<br/>Blacksmiths may apply additional Sockets on their own Bracers with <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=55628/socket-bracer">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/item_socketedbracer.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Socket Bracer</span></a>.<div class="pad"></div>
