<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="waist-for-shadow-priest-dps">Waist for Shadow Priest DPS</h4>You have the choice between gambling on <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=63498/soul-breath-belt">
<img alt="Soul Breath Belt" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_cloth_raidpriest_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Soul Breath Belt</span></a> or buying a BoE with <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=54504/belt-of-the-depths">
<img alt="Belt of the Depths" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_cloth_raidpriest_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Belt of the Depths</span></a>. When just starting off, you might want to grab <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62386/cord-of-the-raven-queen">
<img alt="Cord of the Raven Queen" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_cloth_raidpriest_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Cord of the Raven Queen</span></a>, as you need <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/faction=1158/guardians-of-hyjal">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Guardians of Hyjal</span></a> reputation for your Head enchant anyway, or <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=69611/sash-of-anguish">
<img alt="Sash of Anguish" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_74.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sash of Anguish</span></a>.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Waist Enchant</b>: <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=55054/ebonsteel-belt-buckle">
<img alt="Ebonsteel Belt Buckle" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_83.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Ebonsteel Belt Buckle</span></a>, with <a class="q1 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=41118/nitro-boosts">
<img alt="Nitro Boosts" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gizmo_rocketbootextreme.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Nitro Boosts</span></a> for Engineers.<div class="pad"></div>
