<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="legs-for-shadow-priest-dps">Legs for Shadow Priest DPS</h4>You will eventually want <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71278/leggings-of-the-cleansing-flame">
<img alt="Leggings of the Cleansing Flame" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_robe_raidpriest_j_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Leggings of the Cleansing Flame</span></a>, but they are a lower priority than <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71279/vestment-of-the-cleansing-flame">
<img alt="Vestment of the Cleansing Flame" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_robe_raidpriest_j_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Vestment of the Cleansing Flame</span></a>. Grab any of <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=60255/mercurial-leggings">
<img alt="Mercurial Leggings" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pant_cloth_raidpriest_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Mercurial Leggings</span></a>, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=69601/serpentine-leggings">
