<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="rings-for-shadow-priest-dps">Rings for Shadow Priest DPS</h4>You could absolutely dump all of your <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a> into rings, but I strongly recommend you instead aim for <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=70124/spirit-fragment-band">
<img alt="Spirit Fragment Band" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_29.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Spirit Fragment Band</span></a> together with either <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=69566/shimmerclaw-band">
<img alt="Shimmerclaw Band" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_20.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Shimmerclaw Band</span></a>, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=69571/soul-drain-signet">
<img alt="Soul Drain Signet" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_16.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Soul Drain Signet</span></a>, or <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=69602/signet-of-venoxis">
