<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="trinkets-for-shadow-priest-dps">Trinkets for Shadow Priest DPS</h4>Trinkets are complicated, there are a lot of variables to consider. Generally anything that procs Spirit or Hit Rating will be wasted, as we can't rely on a proc for Hit Cap. Something like <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62465/stump-of-time">
<img alt="Stump of Time" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_branch_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Stump of Time</span></a> is great, but that much Hit Rating can sometimes make it hard to avoid overcapping. For best results, I recommend always simming trinket combos not just picking blindly. <br/>
<br/>Players looking for an easy combo without breaking the bank could grab <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=70142/moonwell-chalice">
<img alt="Moonwell Chalice" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_potion_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Moonwell Chalice</span></a> and either <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=59519/theralions-mirror">
<img alt="Theralion's Mirror" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_arcane_teleportironforge.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Theralion's Mirror</span></a> or <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=59326/bell-of-enraging-resonance">
<img alt="Bell of Enraging Resonance" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_bell_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Bell of Enraging Resonance</span></a>.<div class="pad"></div>
