<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="weapons">Weapons for Shadow Priest DPS</h3>
<div class="pad"></div>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="staves-for-shadow-priest-dps">Staves for Shadow Priest DPS</h4>The Priests yearn for the mines. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=64489/staff-of-sorcerer-thane-thaurissan">
<img alt="Staff of Sorcerer-Thane Thaurissan" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_archaeology_staffofsorcerer_than-thaurissan.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Staff of Sorcerer-Thane Thaurissan</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=64880/staff-of-ammunae">
<img alt="Staff of Ammunae" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_archaeology_staff-of-ammunrae.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Staff of Ammunae</span></a> are fantastic, but they aren't exactly a quick grab. <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56424/soul-releaser">
<img alt="Soul Releaser" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_staff_116.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Soul Releaser</span></a> is a solid option available from Heroics.<br/>
<br/>
