<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="main-hand-weapons-for-shadow-priest-dps">Main Hand Weapons for Shadow Priest DPS</h4>While it is easier to just grab <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56424/soul-releaser">
<img alt="Soul Releaser" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_staff_116.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Soul Releaser</span></a> and call it a day, a main-hand off-hand combo is stronger, especially now that we can enchant our off-hands. If you can get your hands on it, nothing else pre-raid will beat <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=59341/incineratus">
<img alt="Incineratus" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_knife_1h_bwdraid_d_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Incineratus</span></a> or either of the other 359 options. <br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Weapon Enchants</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74242/enchant-weapon-power-torrent">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_formulasuperior_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Weapon - Power Torrent</span></a>
